    <h2>The honest math</h2>
    <p>Webflow is the closest competitor in terms of output quality. The case for a custom-coded site over Webflow is narrower than over Wix or WordPress: <strong>better page-speed ceiling, deeper local-SEO control, no per-tier pricing, full ownership.</strong> If your business does not need any of those, Webflow is fine. If your business depends on local-pack ranking and your traffic is growing, the custom-coded site is structurally better suited.</p>
